### Third-Party Data & Attribution Notices

This Software utilizes publicly available Earth observation, meteorological, and geophysical datasets provided by independent scientific agencies:
1. NASA POWER (Prediction Of Worldwide Energy Resources) — NASA Langley Research Center (LaRC)
2. NASA GIBS (Global Imagery Browse Services) — NASA EOSDIS
3. NASA FIRMS (Fire Information for Resource Management System) — NASA Earthdata
4. NASA EONET (Earth Observatory Natural Event Tracker) — NASA Goddard Space Flight Center (GSFC)
5. USGS Earthquake Hazards Program — U.S. Geological Survey
6. Bangladesh Meteorological Department (BMD) — Government of the People's Republic of Bangladesh
7. Flood Forecasting and Warning Centre (FFWC) — Bangladesh Water Development Board (BWDB)

